{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#card-zh","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"CiteWeave 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 客户端的网页证据与配图插件。它在 Harness 注册 citeweave_search 工具，并提供独立的设置面板连接自托管后端。工具可按问题自动搜索网页，也可指定最多五个公开来源页面；它整理带标题、链接和正文的证据，并筛选、验证图片后将图像作为附件返回，方便回答中配图并引用来源。适合需要资料检索、图解或照片佐证的问答。使用前需部署并运行后端，按需配置地址、访问令牌、超时和图片数；后端可选接入 DeepSeek 视觉 API。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-107","index.js:159-199","client.js:16-27"]}
{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#card-en","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"CiteWeave gives DSH linked web evidence and sourced images. Its search tool can find pages or accept up to five URLs, then returns citations and selected images as Harness attachments. Configure it to connect to a separately deployed backend for research answers with diagrams or photos.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-107","index.js:159-199","client.js:16-27"]}
