{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#feature-1","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteWeave 的功能「网页证据检索」：根据问题搜索网页，或接收最多五个指定页面 URL，并返回页面标题、链接和正文证据。调用 citeweave_search，可通过 urls 指定来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:100-107","index.js:159-168"]}
{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#feature-2","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteWeave 的功能「来源配图」：检索结果中的图片可关联来源页面和说明，并以 Markdown 图片及 Harness 附件形式返回，供回答引用。搜索时自动触发，图片数量受设置限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:169-199"]}
{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#feature-3","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteWeave 的功能「可配置图片验证」：工具参数 verify_images 控制是否请求后端验证候选图片的视觉相关性，refresh 可要求绕过近期证据缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:104-107","index.js:159-162"]}
{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#feature-4","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteWeave 的功能「后端连接设置」：在插件设置页维护后端地址、访问令牌、超时和图片数；保存后影响后续搜索，令牌不会回显。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:8-16","client.js:45-80"]}
{"unit_id":"wavachao__dsh-citeweave#caveat-1","repo":"wavachao/dsh-citeweave","commit":"4248e02a9fdd30ab3e64f4cb5951e5b85d131cf4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"CiteWeave 使用前须知：插件会把搜索问题和可选来源 URL 发给所配置的后端；若后端启用 DeepSeek API 视觉模式，处理图片时还会向 API 发送图像内容。需自行部署后端。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:159-162","backend/src/citeweave/vision.py:75-90","client.js:16"]}
